NAME
    gcloud alpha memorystore acl-policies - manage Acl Policy resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha memorystore acl-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Acl Policy resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (ALPHA) Create aclPolicies.

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete aclPolicies.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe aclPolicies.

     list
        (ALPHA) List aclPolicies.

     update
        (ALPHA) Update aclPolicies.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud memorystore acl-policies

        $ gcloud beta memorystore acl-policies

